Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:59:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] media: wave5: generate sequence VUI from output
 colorimetry

Map OUTPUT color fields into AVC and HEVC VUI RBSP.
Keep coherent VUI storage until successful firmware teardown or reset.
Independent SPS parsing covers 709, sRGB and PQ range signaling;
failure injection verifies ownership across failed encoder close.

Signed-off-by: localhost-copilot <318096335+localhost-copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
